  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "とくべつな　きりかぶの　パワーを\nドラミングで　コントロール。\nねっこを　あやつって　たたかう。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "특별한 그루터기의 파워를\n드럼 연주로 컨트롤한다.\n뿌리를 조종해서 싸운다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "能夠透過打鼓來控制\n特別的樹樁中的力量，\n操縱樹根進行戰鬥。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il contrôle le pouvoir de sa souche singulière\nen tapant en rythme dessus.\nIl se bat en manipulant des racines.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es kontrolliert die Macht seines speziellen\nBaumstumpfes durch Trommeln. Im Kampf\nmanipuliert es damit Wurzeln.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Controla los poderes y las raíces de su singular\ntocón en combate golpeándolo como si fuera\nun tambor.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Controlla il potere del suo ceppo speciale\nusandolo come un tamburo e lotta servendosi\ndelle radici.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "By drumming, it taps into the power of its special\ntree stump. The roots of the stump follow its\ndirection in battle.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "特別な　切り株の　パワーを\nドラミングで　コントロール。\n根っこを　操って　戦う。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "能够通过打鼓来控制\n特别的树桩中的力量，\n操纵树根进行战斗。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Controla los poderes y las raíces de su singular\ntocón en combate golpeándolo como si fuera\nun tambor.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ドラムテクニックに　すぐれた　ものが\nボスになる。　おだやかな　きしょうで\nグループの　ちょうわを　おもんじる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "드럼 테크닉이 가장 뛰어난 자가\n보스가 된다. 천성이 온화해서\n그룹의 조화를 중히 여긴다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "打鼓技巧最高超的那一隻\n會成為首領。性情溫和，\n重視族群的和諧相處。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Celui qui possède les meilleures techniques\nde percussion devient le chef. De nature calme,\nil privilégie l’harmonie du groupe.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Wer die beste Trommeltechnik hat, wird zum\nAnführer. Da es ein ruhiges Gemüt hat, legt es\nviel Wert auf Harmonie in der Gruppe.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "El percusionista con la técnica más depurada se\nconvierte en líder. Son de carácter tranquilo y\ndan mucha importancia a la armonía del grupo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Colui che ha una migliore tecnica di percussione\ndiventa il capo. Ha un carattere tranquillo e\ndà molta importanza all’armonia del gruppo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The one with the best drumming techniques\nbecomes the boss of the troop. It has a gentle\ndisposition and values harmony among its group.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ドラムテクニックに　優れた　ものが\nボスになる。　穏やかな　気性で\nグループの　調和を　重んじる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "打鼓技巧最高超的那一只\n会成为首领。性情温和，\n重视族群的和谐相处。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "El percusionista con la técnica más depurada se\nconvierte en líder. Son de carácter tranquilo y\ndan mucha importancia a la armonía del grupo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "おだやかな　きしょうの　もちぬしだがちょうわを　みだすものは　ゆるさずはんせいするまで　きびしく　しどう。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "온화한 성품을 가졌으나 조화를 해치는 자는 용서하지 않으며 반성할 때까지 엄격하게 지도한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "性情溫和，但對於擾亂和諧的傢伙是絕不輕饒，會嚴格指正直到對方反省為止。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il est calme de nature, mais il ne tolère pas qu’on trouble l’harmonie. Il punit sévèrement les coupables jusqu’à ce qu’ils retiennent la leçon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es besitzt ein ruhiges Gemüt. Doch wer es wagt, die Harmonie zu stören, wird erbarmungslos von Gortrom zurechtgewiesen, bis er Einsicht zeigt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es de carácter tranquilo, pero no tolera a aquellos que quebrantan la armonía y los disciplina hasta que aprenden la lección.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "È d’indole tranquilla ma, non tollerando chi disturba la quiete, lo redarguisce fino a farlo pentire delle proprie azioni.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Though it has a calm disposition, it won’t tolerate those who drum up discord. It strictly disciplines offenders until they learn their lesson.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "穏やかな　気性の　持ち主だが調和を　乱すものは　許さず反省するまで　厳しく　指導。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "虽然拥有温和的性格，但绝不放过扰乱和谐者，会严格训导至其反省为止。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es de carácter tranquilo, pero no tolera a aquellos que quebrantan la armonía y los disciplina hasta que aprenden la lección.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ボスに　いどむものが　あらわれるとドラミングバトルが　はじまりかったほうが　むれの　ボスとなる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "보스에게 도전하는 이가 나타나면 드럼 배틀이 시작되며 이긴 쪽이 무리의 보스가 된다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "當轟擂金剛猩挑戰首領時，雙方就會以擊鼓來對決，勝者會成為群體的新首領。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Quand un Gorythmic défie le chef d’un groupe, il doit l’affronter dans un duel de percussions. Le vainqueur devient le nouveau chef.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Wenn ein Gortrom den Anführer einer Gruppe herausfordert, entbrennt ein Trommelwettkampf. Der Gewinner führt ab dann die Gruppe an.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cuando el líder del grupo es desafiado por otro, comienza una batalla de percusión tras la cual el vencedor se proclama líder.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se un esemplare vuole spodestare il capo di un gruppo, deve batterlo in una sfida di percussioni. Il vincitore viene eletto o riconfermato capo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "When one Rillaboom challenges another who leads a troop, a drumming battle commences. The victor becomes the troop’s new boss.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ボスに　挑むものが　現れるとドラミングバトルが　始まり勝った方が　群れの　ボスとなる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "当首领遇到挑战者时，就会开始打鼓对决，胜者会成为族群的首领。",
